{"id":"glac_on","lemma":"glaçon","pos":"noun","rank":4642,"glosses":["icicle","ice cube, block of ice","an iceberg"],"ipa":"/ɡla.sɔ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/81/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-LoquaxFR-gla%C3%A7on.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-LoquaxFR-gla%C3%A7on.wav.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"glaçons"},"formAudio":{"glaçons":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/18/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-gla%C3%A7ons.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Il y des glaçons sur la maison.","en":"The house has icicles on it.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"there"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null,{"g":"on"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"house, home"}]},{"text":"Avec des glaçons, s'il vous plaît.","en":"On the rocks, please.","words":[{"g":"with"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null,{"g":"oneself / if"},{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to please","l":"plaire"}]},{"text":"Ces glaçons vont bientôt fondre.","en":"These ice cubes will melt soon.","words":[{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},null,{"g":"to go","l":"aller"},{"g":"soon"},{"g":"to melt"}]},{"text":"J'aime mettre un glaçon dans mon café, parce que c'est généralement trop chaud.","en":"I like to put an ice cube into my coffee, because it's usually too hot.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to love","l":"aimer"},{"g":"to put"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"in"},{"g":"my"},{"g":"coffee"},null,null,{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"generally, in general"},{"g":"too"},{"g":"warm, hot"}],"phrases":[[8,10,"because"]]},{"text":"Ce que Tom aime le plus, c'est le whisky avec des glaçons.","en":"What Tom likes most is whiskey on the rocks.","words":[null,null,null,{"g":"to love","l":"aimer"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"more / no longer"},{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"whisky, whiskey"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"what"]]}]}